### Health
GET http://localhost:4000/health

### Gateway introspection-safe probe
GET http://localhost:4000/graphql
Accept: application/json

### GraphQL operation (supply a short-lived token at request time)
POST http://localhost:4000/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv MARKETPLACE_ACCESS_TOKEN}}

{"query":"query Me { me { id } }"}

### MCP tools
POST http://localhost:8000/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv MCP_ACCESS_TOKEN}}

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"tools/list","params":{}}

# Tokens are deliberately read from an uncommitted environment file; never paste values here.
